    "releaseNotes": "Fixed: After changing your Total Daily Goal from the Calories By Meal screen, the old goal wouldn’t update. Now your new goal shows up the moment you hit Save.\n\nFixed: For non-english users, food logged using Quick Add wasn’t showing up in your Diary. The calories counted, but the food vanished. Now your food entries show up where they should.\n\n*Bugs: great for the environment, bad for your logging experience.\n*For all the latest fixes, update to the latest app version",
